      "id": "sol.amc-12b-2010-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The region splits into an \\(8\\times2\\) vertical rectangle and a \\(2\\times3\\) horizontal foot, whose width is \\(5-2=3.\\)\n\nThe total area is \\[ 8\\cdot2+3\\cdot2=16+6=22. \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is A.",
      "hints": [
        "Split the L into two rectangles",
        "The vertical bar is \\(2\\times8,\\) and the foot adds a \\(2\\times3\\) piece since \\(5-2=3\\)"
